  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Release candidate 6 is a security release: rc.5 with its dependencies fixed, and no code changes. Every rc.5 store adapter brought System.Drawing.Common 5.0.0 (GHSA-rxg9-xrhp-64gj, critical) into applications on .NET 5 or later through System.Security.Permissions 5.0.0; upgrade if you use one. GraphDB, Fuseki and Oxigraph no longer reference System.Security.Permissions, and Virtuoso references 10.0.15, which does not bring System.Drawing.Common. No adapter references System.Data.Common 4.3.0 any more, which brought System.Text.RegularExpressions 4.3.0 (GHSA-cmhx-cq75-c4mj, high). The trinity-vocab tool bundles AngleSharp 1.7.1 instead of 1.4.0 (GHSA-pgww-w46g-26qg, moderate). Upgrading from rc.5: a project that pins System.Security.Permissions below 10.0.15 gets NU1605 with the Virtuoso adapter. See CHANGELOG.md.",
